  headerText: Add Fruit to Mixer
  contentText: "Grab a fruit from the tray on the left using LMB, then hover over
    the mixer and press LMB again to drop it in. If you don\u2019t have fruit on
    the tray, go back to the Fruit Bowl Screen and place one there first."
